  "payload": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>Active Directory  Engineer - Rabobank</title>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://rabobank.jobs/en/job/active-directory-engineer/JR_00144349/\"/>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"JobPosting\", \"datePosted\": \"2026-09-15\", \"employmentType\": \"fulltime\", \"description\": \"As an Active Directory Engineer within Tech4IAM, you will play a key role in one of Rabobank's most critical identity platforms. You will help shape the future of Identity & Access Management by modernizing our Active Directory landscape, strengthening federation services, and enabling secure access for employees, applications, machines, and emerging AI-driven capabilities. \\n\\nYour work directly impacts all Rabobank employees. Together with your team, you ensure our identity services remain secure, reliable, scalable, and future proof in an increasingly complex digital world. \\n\\n \\n\\nYou & Your Job \\n\\nIdentity & Access Management (IAM) is a core capability within Rabobank. IAM ensures that people, applications, services, and machines have access to the right resources, at the right time, for the right reasons. \\n\\nAs an Active Directory Engineer, you will be part of the IAM Tribe, responsible for delivering a secure and modern identity fabric across the bank. You will work at the heart of our authentication and identity infrastructure, combining deep Active Directory expertise with modern cloud identity, federation, automation, and AI-related access management challenges. \\n\\nThe world around us is changing rapidly. Geopolitical developments, emerging AI agents, cloud transformation, post-quantum cryptography, and ever-increasing regulatory requirements continuously create new opportunities and challenges. We are looking for someone who is excited by these developments and wants to help define the future of identity within Rabobank. \\n\\nYou will work in a highly skilled and collaborative team where knowledge sharing, innovation, and ownership are key values. We encourage engineers who not only solve technical challenges but also help strengthen the team around them. \\n\\n \\n\\nPractical Examples \\n\\nLead the modernization and decommissioning of legacy identity and authentication solutions throughout the bank. \\n\\nDesign and improve Active Directory and federation architectures. \\n\\nTranslate business and security requirements into practical and sustainable technical solutions. \\n\\nSupport and advise development teams on authentication, authorization, and identity-related integrations. \\n\\nImprove automation, monitoring, and operational excellence across identity services. \\n\\nEnsure IAM data remains reliable, traceable, and compliant with regulatory frameworks such as DORA and NIS2. \\n\\n \\n\\nTop Responsibilities \\n\\nDesign, maintain, and modernize Active Directory services and infrastructure. \\n\\nManage and optimize federation services including ADFS, SAML, OAuth2, and OpenID Connect. \\n\\nDrive hybrid identity solutions across on-premises Active Directory and Microsoft Entra ID. \\n\\nDevelop automation, tooling, and platform capabilities that improve operational efficiency and user experience. \\n\\nDesign and deploy identity solutions across Azure, AWS, and on-premises environments. \\n\\nBuild and improve CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure-as-code capabilities. \\n\\nTroubleshoot complex identity and authentication challenges. \\n\\nAct as a trusted advisor for product owners, architects, engineers, and business stakeholders.\\n\\nHelp create a collaborative, positive, and high-performing engineering culture. \\n\\n \\n\\nTogether We Achieve More Than Alone \\n\\nAt Rabobank, we believe our best results come from teamwork. \\n\\nWe're looking for someone who enjoys collaborating, sharing knowledge, and supporting colleagues. Someone who brings positive energy, challenges ideas constructively, and helps the team succeed together. \\n\\nTechnical excellence is important, but so is being a team player. We value people who create connections, take ownership, and contribute to a culture where everyone can perform at their best. \\n\\nYou will join a team of experienced identity specialists who are passionate about technology, security, and continuous improvement. Together, we safeguard the digital identity of thousands of Rabobank employees. \\n\\n \\n\\nYou & Your Talent \\n\\nA Bachelor's degree or higher in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field. \\n\\nStrong experience with Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS) in large enterprise environments. \\n\\nSolid understanding of authentication and authorization protocols such as: Kerberos,NTLM, LDAP and SAML. \\n\\nA strong automation mindset and experience with infrastructure-as-code and CI/CD practices. \\n\\nExcellent analytical and troubleshooting skills. \\n\\nStrong communication and stakeholder management skills.\\n\\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills in English. \\n\\n \\n\\nNice To Have \\n\\nExperience with identity governance and privileged access management. \\n\\nExperience with AI-assisted engineering or a strong interest in emerging AI technologies. \\n\\nKnowledge of modern cybersecurity frameworks and regulatory requirements. \\n\\nExperience coaching colleagues and sharing technical knowledge. \\n\\nSolid understanding of authentication and authorization protocols such as: Keytab en SCIM \\n\\nExperience with Microsoft Entra ID and hybrid identity architectures. \\n\\nExperience with cloud platforms such as Azure and/or AWS. \\n\\nExcellent written and verbal communication skills in Dutch. \\n\\n \\n\\nWhat Makes You Successful \\n\\nBeing passionate about Identity & Access Management. \\n\\nCurious about new technologies and innovation. \\n\\nPositive, approachable, and collaborative. \\n\\nA natural team player who enjoys helping others succeed. \\n\\nComfortable taking ownership and driving improvements. \\n\\nEager to learn and continuously develop yourself. \\n\\nSomeone who combines technical depth with the ability to bring people together. \\n\\n \\n\\n \\n\\nYou & the application process \\n\\nReply to the vacancy for DevOps Engineer IAM 4 Employees at Rabobank as soon as possible, open until fulfilment.  \\n\\nAny questions about working at Rabobank and the process? Sylvana Janssen, recruiter via redacted@example.invalid. \\n\\nWe will hold the interviews through a video call.  \\n\\nIf you are selected for an interview, Bo, our virtual assistant, will reach out to you via SMS and email to schedule the interview. \\n\\nYou can find answers to the most frequently asked questions on rabobank.jobs/en/faq. \\n\\nA security check is part of the process. \\n\\nWe respect yourprivacy.  \", \"hiringOrganization\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Rabobank\", \"sameAs\": \"https://www.rabobank.com\", \"logo\": \"/images/favicons/android-chrome-512x512.png\"}, \"jobLocation\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Utrecht\", \"streetAddress\": \"Croeselaan 18\", \"postalCode\": \"3521CB\", \"addressCountry\": \"nl\"}}, \"title\": \"Active Directory  Engineer\", \"identifier\": {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"id\", \"value\": \"JR_00144349\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>Active Directory  Engineer</h1>\n<p>Referentienummer JR_00144349</p>\n<p>Utrecht (NL)</p>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
